From 0378c955f9f07dee7f5235dd53dd557930ebc458 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: meh <no-reply@pathscale.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:21:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 05/23] Name boxed AST nodes through a P<T> alias

P<T> is Box<T> for now, so behaviour and layout are unchanged. Boxed
Expr, Item, AssocItem, ForeignItem, Fn, Ty, Pat and Block edges are
spelled P<..> in the AST crates, which gives the arena move one
definition to change. THIR and typeck boxes are left alone.
